#: ../../source/docs/ArduSub_MAVLink_Messages.rst:5
#: 71ada683f9a44f13825d5fe2c2951c5b
msgid "MAVLink Messages"
msgstr "MAVLink 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduSub_MAVLink_Messages.rst:8
#: 8491706506314e13a5f6f3044a37dad7
msgid ""
"The `MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`_ protocol supports a variety of "
"features and functionalities, but not all `messages "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/>`_ or `commands "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/command.html>`_ are implemented by the "
"ArduPilot ecosystem, or relevant to a particular autopilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"`MAVLink <https://mavlink.io/en/>`_ 协议支持多种特性与功能，但并非所有 `消息 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/>`_ 或 `命令 "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/services/command.html>`_ 都由 ArduPilot "
"生态系统实现，也并非都与特定的自动驾驶仪固件相关。"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduSub_MAVLink_Messages.rst:10
#: 8382e6d7fabc47fb90d73975361a372e
msgid ""
"This page is auto-generated from analysing the ArduSub source code, and "
"provides an indication of which messages (and commands) are handled by, "
"requestable from, and sent from the firmware. A message being handled does "
"not guarantee full support, but at least shows that the autopilot is aware "
"it exists, and will try to do something meaningful with it."
msgstr ""
"本页面由 ArduSub "
"源代码分析自动生成，指明了哪些消息（及命令）由固件处理、可从固件请求以及由固件发送。消息被处理并不保证完全支持，但至少表明自动驾驶仪知道该消息的存在，并会尝试对其进行有意义的操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduSub_MAVLink_Messages.rst:12
#: 61a0c11829b847be917bbdc922ab2ab5
msgid ""
"Known :ref:`unsupported messages <ArduSub_mavlink_missing_messages>` (and "
"commands) are shown at the end."
msgstr "已知的 :ref:`不支持的消息 <ArduSub_mavlink_missing_messages>`（及命令）列于页面末尾。"

#: ../../source/docs/ArduSub_MAVLink_Messages.rst:14
#: 5de4bebfe0c34760ada0742b007092fd
msgid ""
"The autopilot includes a set of :ref:`ArduSub_mavlink_stream_groups` for "
"convenience, which allow configuring the stream rates of groups of "
"requestable messages by setting parameter values. It is also possible to "
"manually request messages, and request individual messages be streamed at a "
"specified rate."
msgstr ""
"自动驾驶仪为方便起见提供了一组 "
":ref:`ArduSub_mavlink_stream_groups`，可通过设置参数值来配置可请求消息组的流速率。也可以手动请求消息，并请求以指定速率流式传输单条消息。"

